@startuml
!include _style.iuml
title CMake target 依賴規則：箭頭只能往下（違反時建置失敗）
skinparam nodesep 60
skinparam ranksep 70
[wasm_bindings\n（客戶端出口）] as wasm
[server\n（後端出口）] as server
[sync\n同步] as sync
[io\n匯入匯出] as io
[core\n排程・領域・分析] as core #DDEFD9
wasm -down-> sync
wasm -down-> io
server -down-> sync
server -down-> io
sync -down-> core
io -down-> core
wasm -down-> core
server -down-> core
wasm .[#C0392B]right.> server : <color:#C0392B>禁止</color>
note right of core
  只依賴標準函式庫
  不做 I/O、不 include 平台標頭
  <color:#C0392B>任何往上的依賴都禁止</color>
end note
@enduml
